-- title:
--   Exact seventh-row square-root polynomial and residual data
-- statement:
--   Define the fixed rational twenty-entry coefficient vectors $a,b$, the polynomial $P_7(u)=1+u\sum_{i<20}a_i u^i$, the residual $T_7(u)=\sum_{i<20}b_i u^i$, and $R_7(u)=1-(2618/699)u+(2890/699)u^2-(122825/81783)u^3+(417605/981396)u^4$. All rational entries are retained exactly in the formal definition.
